{
    "title": "Drivvo - car management",
    "description": "WHY USE DRIVVO?\r\nDo you know how much you spend on your vehicle? When should you do the next review? Which fuel is most efficient for your vehicle?\r\n\r\nRegister, organize and track all the information on your car, motorcycle, truck, bus or fleet whenever you want and wherever you are, via smartphone, tablet or computer.\r\n\r\nNow you can fully manage your fleet, managing Refuelling, Expenses, Maintenances (preventive and corrective), Incomes, Routes, Checklists and Reminders.\r\n\r\nClearly view and monitor the evolution of information related to your vehicle is possible through reports and graphs available in the application.\r\n\r\n\u2022 REFUELING:\r\nFuel control is the most important part of managing your vehicle. With the application, you can fill in the refuelling data in real time, giving more agility to the management.\r\nFrom the information filled in, graphs and reports are generated that allow access to data such as: average consumption, costs per kilometer traveled, kilometers traveled, among others.\r\nThe resource allows you to easily identify if there is a problem with the vehicle and if there is a need for maintenance.\r\n\r\n\u2022 CHECKLIST\r\nCreate custom forms to run inspections on your vehicles, ensuring your vehicle is roadworthy. This reduces the risk of mechanical problems in remote or unfamiliar locations.\r\nThe vehicular checklist helps you identify and fix safety issues before they become dangerous. Items such as brakes, tires, lights and seat belts can be checked regularly to ensure the vehicle is in safe operating condition.\r\n\r\n\u2022 EXPENSE\r\nDrivvo allows you to have total control over your vehicle's expenses, registering taxes, insurance, fines, parking, among other expenses.\r\n\r\n\u2022 SERVICE\r\nOil changes, brake checks, tire changes, filters, air conditioning cleaning. All these services can be easily viewed in the app.\r\n\r\n\u2022 INCOME\r\nDrivvo also makes it possible to record recipes, to make life easier for drivers who use their vehicle as a work tool, such as transport app drivers, for example.\r\n\r\n\u2022 ROUTE\r\nHave a record of all trips that are made on a day-to-day basis.\r\nIf you use your vehicle for work and receive per kilometer driven, Drivvo helps you organize and calculate travel reimbursements.\r\nFor the fleet manager, it makes it easier to identify the driver who was driving.\r\n\r\n\u2022 REMINDER\r\nHaving scheduled preventive maintenance is another fundamental activity in managing your vehicle.\r\nWith the help of the app, you can set reminders to control regular services such as oil change, tire replacement, inspection and overhaul, being able to schedule by kilometer or date.\r\n\r\n\u2022 FLEET MANAGEMENT\r\nDrivvo is a vehicle fleet management system that allows the manager to have full control over vehicles and drivers.\r\nSee more:\r\nhttps://www.drivvo.com/en/fleet-management\r\n\r\n\u2022 DRIVER MANAGEMENT\r\nHave complete control of drivers in each vehicle, manage driver's licenses, get reports by vehicle and period.\r\n\r\n\u2022 DETAILED REPORTS AND CHARTS\r\nAccess the information of each vehicle, separated by date and modules. Visualize the performance of the fleet through graphs, which help in decision making.\r\n\r\nFor personal use and for who use their vehicle for work\r\nUber, taxi, Cabify, 99\r\n\r\n\u2022 Pro version benefits:\r\n- Backup data of your vehicle in the cloud\r\n- Synchronize data between devices\r\n- No advertising\r\n- Export data to CSV/Excel\r\n\r\nYou can also restore data from other apps.\r\naCar, Car Expenses, Fuelio, Fuel Log, Fuel Manager, My Cars\r\n\r\nFuel:\r\nGasoline\r\nEthanol\r\nDiesel\r\nLPG\r\nCNG\r\nElectric\r\n\r\nExpenses:\r\nFine\r\nPayment\r\nRegistration\r\nTax\r\nTolls\r\n\r\nServices:\r\nOil Change\r\nBattery\r\nLights\r\nNew Tires\r\nInspection\r\n\r\nDistance:\r\nKilometer (km)\r\nMile (mi)",
    "descriptionHTML": "WHY USE DRIVVO?<br>Do you know how much you spend on your vehicle? When should you do the next review? Which fuel is most efficient for your vehicle?<br><br>Register, organize and track all the information on your car, motorcycle, truck, bus or fleet whenever you want and wherever you are, via smartphone, tablet or computer.<br><br>Now you can fully manage your fleet, managing Refuelling, Expenses, Maintenances (preventive and corrective), Incomes, Routes, Checklists and Reminders.<br><br>Clearly view and monitor the evolution of information related to your vehicle is possible through reports and graphs available in the application.<br><br>\u2022 REFUELING:<br>Fuel control is the most important part of managing your vehicle. With the application, you can fill in the refuelling data in real time, giving more agility to the management.<br>From the information filled in, graphs and reports are generated that allow access to data such as: average consumption, costs per kilometer traveled, kilometers traveled, among others.<br>The resource allows you to easily identify if there is a problem with the vehicle and if there is a need for maintenance.<br><br>\u2022 CHECKLIST<br>Create custom forms to run inspections on your vehicles, ensuring your vehicle is roadworthy. This reduces the risk of mechanical problems in remote or unfamiliar locations.<br>The vehicular checklist helps you identify and fix safety issues before they become dangerous. Items such as brakes, tires, lights and seat belts can be checked regularly to ensure the vehicle is in safe operating condition.<br><br>\u2022 EXPENSE<br>Drivvo allows you to have total control over your vehicle&#39;s expenses, registering taxes, insurance, fines, parking, among other expenses.<br><br>\u2022 SERVICE<br>Oil changes, brake checks, tire changes, filters, air conditioning cleaning. All these services can be easily viewed in the app.<br><br>\u2022 INCOME<br>Drivvo also makes it possible to record recipes, to make life easier for drivers who use their vehicle as a work tool, such as transport app drivers, for example.<br><br>\u2022 ROUTE<br>Have a record of all trips that are made on a day-to-day basis.<br>If you use your vehicle for work and receive per kilometer driven, Drivvo helps you organize and calculate travel reimbursements.<br>For the fleet manager, it makes it easier to identify the driver who was driving.<br><br>\u2022 REMINDER<br>Having scheduled preventive maintenance is another fundamental activity in managing your vehicle.<br>With the help of the app, you can set reminders to control regular services such as oil change, tire replacement, inspection and overhaul, being able to schedule by kilometer or date.<br><br>\u2022 FLEET MANAGEMENT<br>Drivvo is a vehicle fleet management system that allows the manager to have full control over vehicles and drivers.<br>See more:<br>https://www.drivvo.com/en/fleet-management<br><br>\u2022 DRIVER MANAGEMENT<br>Have complete control of drivers in each vehicle, manage driver&#39;s licenses, get reports by vehicle and period.<br><br>\u2022 DETAILED REPORTS AND CHARTS<br>Access the information of each vehicle, separated by date and modules. Visualize the performance of the fleet through graphs, which help in decision making.<br><br>For personal use and for who use their vehicle for work<br>Uber, taxi, Cabify, 99<br><br>\u2022 Pro version benefits:<br>- Backup data of your vehicle in the cloud<br>- Synchronize data between devices<br>- No advertising<br>- Export data to CSV/Excel<br><br>You can also restore data from other apps.<br>aCar, Car Expenses, Fuelio, Fuel Log, Fuel Manager, My Cars<br><br>Fuel:<br>Gasoline<br>Ethanol<br>Diesel<br>LPG<br>CNG<br>Electric<br><br>Expenses:<br>Fine<br>Payment<br>Registration<br>Tax<br>Tolls<br><br>Services:<br>Oil Change<br>Battery<br>Lights<br>New Tires<br>Inspection<br><br>Distance:<br>Kilometer (km)<br>Mile (mi)",
